[en.IDEA_C12_ECONOMIC_CONTROL_OF_LAS_PEGASUS]
Economic control of Las Pegasus

[en.IDEA_C12_ECONOMIC_CONTROL_OF_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
We fell into the trap set by Las Pegasus. To prevent the economic collapse of the rock farm, we are forced to be subservient to Las Pegasus until we find an opportunity to resist. However, from another perspective, at least we can more conveniently establish economic connections and gain technological advancements.

[zh.IDEA_C12_ECONOMIC_CONTROL_OF_LAS_PEGASUS]
洛马基经济控制

[zh.IDEA_C12_ECONOMIC_CONTROL_OF_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
我们中了洛马基的圈套，为了避免采石农场的经济崩溃，在我们找到反抗的机会前，我们被迫受制于洛马基，但从其他角度来看，至少我们能更加方便的建立经济联系和获得科技提升。
